      "side": 1,
      "message": "I still don\u0027t understand this. Please let me know exactly what configuration causes an issue so I can take a look. (\"In some cases\" is not enough information here.) `sanitize` is in the `declare_args()` of `gn/BUILDCONFIG.gn` so should be set in every build of Skia done in Skia. It appears that this is done in `gn/BUILDCONFIG.gn` so that it is always set everywhere (it appears `third_party/freetype2/BUILD.gn` is using it to default to building FreeType from source in an MSAN build).\n\nNow if it is some flutter or other build, then maybe I could see some issue happening, though I\u0027m not sure why this file would come up in those builds. This file is specifically Skia Build setting itself up to build Skia. Other projects would set up their general build in their own way and shouldn\u0027t be using this file?",
      "revId": "437fe1b1cfb1787e6f9d6a34abea9c501903ccd6",
