      "author": {
        "id": 8956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T22:25:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I see few ways out of it:\n1. icu_bidi/BUILD.gn and ask Flutter to build its own.\n2. Remove icu_bidi/BUILD.gn and modify icu/BUILD.gn so it can build only bidi part of it when needed (but still, Flutter will have to do the same)\n3. Try to share icu_bidi/BUILD.gn but without using third_party.gni (not sure if it can be done, but I can try)",
      "parentUuid": "d60cac19_243d042f",
      "revId": "437fe1b1cfb1787e6f9d6a34abea9c501903ccd6",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
