      "message": "@mdebbar\nYou should remove the `SK_USING_THIRD_PARTY_ICU` define there.\n\nThere\u0027s no reason to do both the `include_dirs` and the `foreach` `cflags +\u003d`. Skia\u0027s `third_party` template doesn\u0027t actually forward the `include_dirs` (that\u0027s why `include_dirs` is in the exclusion list in the line `forward_variables_from(invoker, \"*\", [ \"include_dirs\" ])`. The reason for what it is doing is to include the icu headers as \"system headers\" since that has the side effect of suppressing any warnings those headers might generate. Not sure how you want to handle that on the flutter side.\n\n@jlavrova\nThis change to `gn/skia/BUILD.gn` should be removed from this change now.",
